      "side": 1,
      "message": "Calling callbacks from `fp_driver` structure is not a Zephyr friendly approach.\n\nFrom a user perspective, Zephyr API is a set of functions. These functions make necessary checks and call appropriate driver function (if implemented).\n\nWith `fp_driver` we will have two layers of indirect calls. With functions, I can make them `inline`, so the overhead will be minimal.",
